---
title: Zolto Native Diagram & Chart Engine Showcase
---

# Zolto Phase 6 — Native Diagrams & Data Visualizations

Zolto Phase 6 introduces native charts alongside the deterministic, native diagram and graph engine, compiling human-readable `@diagram` and `@chart` directives into clean, accessible SVG directly within `.zl` documents.

---

## 1. Flowchart with Custom Theme & Groups

@diagram flowchart id="app-startup" theme="custom:night" layout="hierarchical" aria="Application startup flow"
  node boot.start   [label="Boot", shape="circle"]
  node load.config  [label="Load Config", shape="round-rect"]
  node init.ui      [label="Init UI", shape="round-rect"]
  node ready        [label="Ready", shape="circle"]

  boot.start -> load.config [label="read"]
  load.config -> init.ui [label="apply theme"]
  init.ui -> ready [label="show window"]

  group startup.group [label="Startup Stage"]
    boot.start
    load.config
    init.ui
  @/group
@/diagram

---

## 2. Sequence Diagram

@diagram sequence id="login-seq" aria="Login authentication sequence"
  actor User
  actor App
  actor Server

  User -> App: Enter credentials
  App -> Server: Authenticate POST /login
  Server -> App: Token
  App -> User: Success
@/diagram

---

## 3. State Machine

@diagram state id="state-machine" layout="hierarchical"
  [*] -> Idle
  Idle -> Loading [label="Fetch"]
  Loading -> Ready [label="Success"]
  Loading -> Error [label="Failure"]
  Error -> Idle [label="Retry"]
@/diagram

---

## 4. Entity Relationship Diagram

@diagram er id="db-schema"
  entity User
  entity Order
  entity Product

  User ||--o{ Order
  Order }o--|| Product
@/diagram

---

## 5. Mindmap with Radial Layout

@diagram mindmap id="feature-ideas" layout="radial"
  Root -> UI
  Root -> Performance
  Root -> Security
  Root -> Documentation
@/diagram

---

## 6. Network Diagram with Force-Directed Layout

@diagram network id="infra-topology" layout="force"
  Router -> Switch
  Switch -> Server1
  Switch -> Server2
  Switch -> DB
@/diagram

---

## 7. Class Diagram

@diagram class id="uml-classes"
  class User {
    +id: string
    +name: string
    +login()
  }

  class Order {
    +id: string
    +total: number
  }

  User --> Order
@/diagram

---

## 8. Cross References & Auto Node Resolution

@diagram dependency id="deps-showcase"
  UI -> Auth
  Auth -> DB
  UI -> Logger

  ref DB as database.main
  ref Logger as system.logger

  Auth -> database.main
  UI -> system.logger
@/diagram
